mapping "d620.1" source="d620" target="SNOMED_CT:300718007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source ICF d620 SNOMED CT 300718007 = the d620 3-level chapter code for acquiring goods and
        services (shopping, gathering daily necessities). Target, SE synonym. SNOMED CT frames it as the
        ability-assessment on the same topic axis (acquiring goods/services); it subsumes the ICF
        activity, so the target is broader (subsumes the topic), not a 1:1 exact equivalent — the d620
        parent also spans gathering services, which the shopping concept covers only partially, but
        shopping is the dominant, best-covered axis. High tier per §1 (one-level broader, same verified
        SNOMED CT functional observable hierarchy).
        """
}
